Pre-test coverage calibration fixtures
  tests/fixtures/pretest-calibration.json derives scalar calibration inputs
  from Jonathan Roth (2022), Pre-test with Caution: Event-study Estimates
  After Testing for Parallel Trends, and the twelve studies named in the fixture.
  Archive: https://www.openicpsr.org/openicpsr/project/151982/version/V1/view
  Modified: exported selected coefficients and covariances; computed coverage
  references for de Chaisemartin and D'Haultfoeuille, SSRN 4975578.
  The archive LICENSE assigns CC BY 4.0 to data and BSD-3-Clause to code;
  its README contains a conflicting later CC-BY-NC paragraph. The original
  licence is preserved in licenses/upstream/Roth-archive-LICENSE.txt.
  No archive analysis code was copied into the numerical kernel.
